# ============================================
#  WHITELIST MODEL — everything is ignored
#  unless explicitly allowed below.
#
#  If it is not the published word of the
#  Meridian AI Standard, it does not belong here.
# ============================================

# Ignore everything by default
*

# ============================================
#  ALLOWED: The published Meridian AI Standard
# ============================================

# Repo infrastructure
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!LICENSE

# The canonical generalized MERIDIAN.md (single source of truth) plus the distilled companion
# and the operational practice file (the third tool of the Implementation depth ladder).
!MERIDIAN.md
!MERIDIAN.distilled.md
!MERIDIAN.implementation.md

# Root surfaces: constitutional document, MERIDIAN.md adoption pages, Implementation
# depth-ladder pages, and changelog. The retired meridian-md-template.mdx page is
# no longer published from the public repository.
!meridian-ai-standard.mdx
!meridian-md.mdx
!implementation.mdx
!meridian-md-distilled.mdx
!meridian-implementation.mdx
!changelog.mdx

# The AI Model Assessment (method page and Range Locator Details records). The
# instrument is the AI Model Assessment (one assessment, three readings); "Range
# Locator" is its visual layer. Probe methodology lives inside the comparable
# reading. The former /audit section moved to /assessment on 2026-06-25; the
# retired probes/ directory and probes-implementation.mdx are not whitelisted.
!assessment/
!assessment/*.mdx
!assessment/evidence/
!assessment/evidence/2026-07-16-gemini-3-5-flash-high/
!assessment/evidence/2026-07-16-gemini-3-5-flash-high/*
!assessment/evidence/2026-07-20-claude-opus-4-8-adaptive-high/
!assessment/evidence/2026-07-20-claude-opus-4-8-adaptive-high/*

# The Case Record (landing and cases)
!cases/
!cases/*.mdx
